---
description: Testing conventions
globs: SunniesTests/**/*.swift, SunniesUITests/**/*.swift
---
- Unit tests: Swift Testing (`@Test`, `#expect`, parameterized `arguments:`). UI tests: XCTest.
- Mock services take `latency: .zero` in tests.
- Every new confidence or failure state needs a fixture and a test; fixtures must pass `ConfidencePolicy` unchanged.
- UI tests select scenarios with `-SunniesMockScenario <name>`.
